# The Rootcore (CIPlay the_rootcore): the core valves refused before the Blightmother falls; then BURN (alone, with
# no Heart choice held, either valve works); the second valve refused after.
island The Rootcore
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Core
zone mouth
expect step 1
read Expedition sign
expect step 2
zone dome
expect step 3
use coreburn
expect story core 0
kill Warthog
expect step 4
kill Mama bear
zone old_root
expect step 6
read The Ringwave root
expect step 7
use coreburn
expect story core 1
expect shown embers
expect shown heartseed
use coreopen
expect hidden glowgrowth
expect step 8
read The core
expect step 9
use heartseed
expect story heartseed 1
expect step 10
zone oda_camp
expect step 11
read Oda Fenn's farewell
expect done
